    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>With our easy-to-use slider plugin, you can create eye-catching slideshows that will fascinate your visitors. Whether you want a simple image carousel or a complex, animated masterpiece, you can bring your vision to life.</p>\n<p>This plugin use <a href=\"https://swiperjs.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Swiper JS</a> library for sliders.</p>\n<h3>USEFUL LINK</h3>\n<p><a href=\"http://wpmet.com/support-help/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Get a Quick Support</a></p>\n<h3>💪 Key Features:</h3>\n<p><strong>Easy Customizations &#8211;</strong> Lets you make your personalized sliders. You can choose direction, spacing, and autoplay based on your preferences.</p>\n<p><strong>Web Visibility &#8211;</strong> Display your slider on any device, whether it&#8217;s a computer, phone, or tablet.</p>\n<p><strong>Sticky Slider &#8211;</strong> With this feature, you can make the sliders always visible on your website to get more attention.</p>\n<p><strong>Tempting Animated Sliders &#8211;</strong> The sliders are more interesting with cool animation effects now.</p>\n<p><strong>Live Preview and Editing &#8211;</strong> See changes to your Gutenberg slider instantly as you make them.</p>\n<p><strong>Flexible Style Adjustments &#8211;</strong> Controls are super adjustable and allow you to customize sliders to match your website&#8217;s look.</p>\n<h3>**Captivating Sliding Effects**</h3>\n<p>✓ Fade Effect<br />\n✓ Cube Effect<br />\n✓ Flip Effect<br />\n✓ Card Effect<br />\n✓ Coverflow Effect<br />\n✓ Creative Effect<br />\n✓ Progress Effect<br />\n✓ Panorama Effect</p>\n<h3>Why should you use Rox Slider</h3>\n<p>💠 Rox Slider works perfectly with Gutenberg.<br />\n💠 Diverse setting options.<br />\n💠 It is greatly customizable and handy.<br />\n💠 Provides quick responsive designs.<br />\n💠 Offers advanced motion effects to make appealing sliders.</p>\n<h3>😎 BACKED BY A TRUSTED TEAM</h3>\n<p>Rox Slider is brought to you by <strong>Wpmet, a name trusted by 10,00,000+ satisfied users worldwide</strong>.</p>\n<h3>» SOCIAL MEDIA SUPPORT</h3>\n<p>🙋🏼‍♂️ Join Our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/wpmet/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Facebook Community</a><br />\n👍 Like our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wpmetcom\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Facebook Page</a><br />\n🌐 Follow us on  <a href=\"https://x.com/wpmetcom\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">X (Twitter)</a><br />\n🌐 Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wpmetcom?igsh=MXBueWl2aGg1M2dmbQ==\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Instagram</a><br />\n🌐 Connect on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpmet/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LinkedIn</a><br />\n⭐️ Rate us on <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/metform/reviews/#new-post\" rel=\"ugc\">WordPress</a></p>\n<h3>☂️ Our Other Plugins</h3>\n<p>If you like using Rox Slider plugin for Gutenberg, then consider checking out our other plugins:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/elementskit/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">ElementsKit</a> – All-in-one Addons for Elementor featuring 70+ widgets.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/metform/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">MetForm</a> – The most flexible and easy-to-use form builder.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/shopengine/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">ShopEngine</a> – The most complete WooCommerce solution for Elementor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://getgenie.ai/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GetGenie Ai</a>  GetGenie AI is an AI-powered Content &amp; SEO Assistant. You can access it as a WordPress plugin and a SaaS model. The tool also offers a chatbot called <a href=\"https://getgenie.ai/geniechat/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GenieChat</a> and an AI image generator named <a href=\"https://getgenie.ai/genie-image/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Genie Image</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/emailkit/\" rel=\"ugc\">EmailKit</a> &#8211; The most flexible # WooCommerce Email Customizer.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/gutenkit/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GutenKit</a> &#8211; It is the Ultimate no-code solution for Gutenberg.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/table-builder-block/\" rel=\"ugc\">TableKit</a> – Make fully-customizable multipurpose table &amp; generate data table within Gutenberg block editor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/wp-social/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WP Social</a> – Leverage WP Social to add Social Login, Social Counter, and Social Login to your website.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://products.wpmet.com/crowdfunding/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FundEngine</a> – Employ the power of WP Fundraising to create a crowdfunding and donation site with WordPress.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://products.wpmet.com/review/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WP Ultimate Review</a> – Manage customer reviews with the WP Ultimate Review plugin.</p>\n<p>Visit <a href=\"https://wpmet.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Wpmet</a> to learn more about how to get the best of WordPress with <a href=\"https://wpmet.com/blog\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Tutorials, Tips &amp; Tricks</a>!</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>This plugin connects to the <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google Web Fonts</a> to retrieve a specific list of fonts to use accross plugin dashboard texts.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Dashboard</li>\n<li>Navigate to Plugins &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Search for Rox Slider</li>\n<li>Install and Activate the plugin</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20customize%20the%20slider%27s%20responsiveness%20for%20different%20screen%20sizes%3F'>\nCan I customize the slider&#8217;s responsiveness for different screen sizes?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Absolutely! The Rox Slider slider block is fully responsive, allowing you to tailor its appearance and behavior to various screen sizes.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20add%20different%20types%20of%20content%20to%20my%20slider%20block%3F'>\nCan I add different types of content to my slider block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yes, you can add various types of content to your slider block, including Images, Text, Videos, Calls to action, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20use%20this%20plugin%3F'>\nHow do I use this plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Once the plugin is activated, navigate to the editor of any post or page. In the block search, look for &#8220;Rox Slider&#8221;. Select this block to create and insert sliders into your content.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>Rox Slider: 1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Inital Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Presenting a slider builder to captivate your audience through eye-catching sliders. Customize effortlessly in Gutenberg.",
    "description": "<p>With our easy-to-use slider plugin, you can create eye-catching slideshows that will fascinate your visitors. Whether you want a simple image carousel or a complex, animated masterpiece, you can bring your vision to life.</p>\n<p>This plugin use <a href=\"https://swiperjs.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Swiper JS</a> library for sliders.</p>\n<h3>USEFUL LINK</h3>\n<p><a href=\"http://wpmet.com/support-help/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Get a Quick Support</a></p>\n<h3>💪 Key Features:</h3>\n<p><strong>Easy Customizations &#8211;</strong> Lets you make your personalized sliders. You can choose direction, spacing, and autoplay based on your preferences.</p>\n<p><strong>Web Visibility &#8211;</strong> Display your slider on any device, whether it&#8217;s a computer, phone, or tablet.</p>\n<p><strong>Sticky Slider &#8211;</strong> With this feature, you can make the sliders always visible on your website to get more attention.</p>\n<p><strong>Tempting Animated Sliders &#8211;</strong> The sliders are more interesting with cool animation effects now.</p>\n<p><strong>Live Preview and Editing &#8211;</strong> See changes to your Gutenberg slider instantly as you make them.</p>\n<p><strong>Flexible Style Adjustments &#8211;</strong> Controls are super adjustable and allow you to customize sliders to match your website&#8217;s look.</p>\n<h3>**Captivating Sliding Effects**</h3>\n<p>✓ Fade Effect<br />\n✓ Cube Effect<br />\n✓ Flip Effect<br />\n✓ Card Effect<br />\n✓ Coverflow Effect<br />\n✓ Creative Effect<br />\n✓ Progress Effect<br />\n✓ Panorama Effect</p>\n<h3>Why should you use Rox Slider</h3>\n<p>💠 Rox Slider works perfectly with Gutenberg.<br />\n💠 Diverse setting options.<br />\n💠 It is greatly customizable and handy.<br />\n💠 Provides quick responsive designs.<br />\n💠 Offers advanced motion effects to make appealing sliders.</p>\n<h3>😎 BACKED BY A TRUSTED TEAM</h3>\n<p>Rox Slider is brought to you by <strong>Wpmet, a name trusted by 10,00,000+ satisfied users worldwide</strong>.</p>\n<h3>» SOCIAL MEDIA SUPPORT</h3>\n<p>🙋🏼‍♂️ Join Our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/wpmet/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Facebook Community</a><br />\n👍 Like our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wpmetcom\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Facebook Page</a><br />\n🌐 Follow us on  <a href=\"https://x.com/wpmetcom\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">X (Twitter)</a><br />\n🌐 Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wpmetcom?igsh=MXBueWl2aGg1M2dmbQ==\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Instagram</a><br />\n🌐 Connect on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpmet/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LinkedIn</a><br />\n⭐️ Rate us on <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/metform/reviews/#new-post\" rel=\"ugc\">WordPress</a></p>\n<h3>☂️ Our Other Plugins</h3>\n<p>If you like using Rox Slider plugin for Gutenberg, then consider checking out our other plugins:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/elementskit/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">ElementsKit</a> – All-in-one Addons for Elementor featuring 70+ widgets.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/metform/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">MetForm</a> – The most flexible and easy-to-use form builder.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/shopengine/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">ShopEngine</a> – The most complete WooCommerce solution for Elementor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://getgenie.ai/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GetGenie Ai</a>  GetGenie AI is an AI-powered Content &amp; SEO Assistant. You can access it as a WordPress plugin and a SaaS model. The tool also offers a chatbot called <a href=\"https://getgenie.ai/geniechat/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GenieChat</a> and an AI image generator named <a href=\"https://getgenie.ai/genie-image/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Genie Image</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/emailkit/\" rel=\"ugc\">EmailKit</a> &#8211; The most flexible # WooCommerce Email Customizer.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/gutenkit/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GutenKit</a> &#8211; It is the Ultimate no-code solution for Gutenberg.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/table-builder-block/\" rel=\"ugc\">TableKit</a> – Make fully-customizable multipurpose table &amp; generate data table within Gutenberg block editor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpmet.com/plugin/wp-social/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WP Social</a> – Leverage WP Social to add Social Login, Social Counter, and Social Login to your website.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://products.wpmet.com/crowdfunding/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FundEngine</a> – Employ the power of WP Fundraising to create a crowdfunding and donation site with WordPress.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://products.wpmet.com/review/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WP Ultimate Review</a> – Manage customer reviews with the WP Ultimate Review plugin.</p>\n<p>Visit <a href=\"https://wpmet.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Wpmet</a> to learn more about how to get the best of WordPress with <a href=\"https://wpmet.com/blog\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Tutorials, Tips &amp; Tricks</a>!</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>This plugin connects to the <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google Web Fonts</a> to retrieve a specific list of fonts to use accross plugin dashboard texts.</li>\n</ul>\n",
